{"id":"202508","t":{"th":"สืบมรดกข้ามชาติ หยาดเทวะ","ro":"Kami no Shizuku","en":"The Drops of God","na":"神の雫"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx202508-dk6LEyevJYUY.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx202508-dk6LEyevJYUY.jpg","color":"#e44386","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/202508-K276v0truxE0.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":24,"dur":24,"season":"SPRING","year":2026,"start":"2026-04-10","country":"JP","genres":["Drama","Mystery","Slice of Life"],"score":58,"pop":6298,"studio":"Satelight","desc":"World-renowned wine critic Yutaka Kanzaki has passed away, leaving behind a wine collection worth over 12 billion yen. His will states that his collection will be given to the one who can identify the origin and year of twelve wines he’s chosen, the “Twelve Apostles”, and one that’s superior even to them, “The Drops of God”.\n\nCompeting for the prize are Yutaka’s son, Shizuku, who received a world-class education in wine but rebelled against his father and has never drank a drop, and Issei Tomine, a young charismatic wine critic whom Yutaka had recently adopted as his son.\n\nWhat is wine? What is a parent and a child? What is life?\n\nThe complex and fragrant battle surrounding the legendary ”Drops of God” is about to begin…","descTh":"นักวิจารณ์ไวน์ชื่อดังระดับโลก ยูทากะ คันซากิ เสียชีวิตแล้ว โดยทิ้งคอลเลกชันไวน์มูลค่ากว่า 12 พันล้านเยนไว้เบื้องหลัง พินัยกรรมของเขาระบุว่าคอลเลกชันของเขาจะมอบให้กับคนที่สามารถระบุแหล่งที่มาและปีของไวน์สิบสองที่เขาเลือกได้ ซึ่งก็คือ \"อัครสาวกสิบสอง\" และอีกหนึ่งคนที่เหนือกว่าแม้แต่กับพวกเขา \"หยดของพระเจ้า\"\n\nผู้แข่งขันเพื่อชิงรางวัล ได้แก่ ชิซึกุ ลูกชายของยูทากะ ผู้ซึ่งได้รับการศึกษาระดับโลกด้านไวน์แต่กลับกบฏต่อพ่อของเขาและไม่เคยดื่มเลยแม้แต่หยดเดียว และอิซเซ โทมิเนะ นักวิจารณ์ไวน์หนุ่มผู้มีเสน่ห์ ซึ่งยูทากะรับเลี้ยงเป็นลูกชายของเขาเมื่อเร็ว ๆ นี้\n\nไวน์คืออะไร? พ่อแม่และลูกคืออะไร? ชีวิตคืออะไร?\n\nการต่อสู้ที่ซับซ้อนและหอมหวลโดยรอบ \"Drops of God\" ในตำนานกำลังจะเริ่มต้นขึ้น...","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"Oz5EkYVJbBc","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/202508","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/62981","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"tropics","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbuF5Onrcu9frQPWKvONwgcFOosZf3hQr","lang":"sub","eps":[["24","y:9-j2QrN6u6A",1792231745,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.7,1420.0]],"fin":1}],["23","y:dZcPUUNMR18",1792058945,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["22","y:GbZzydYBMWo",1791454145,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["21","y:CRZHO-suUec",1790676545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["20","y:SYGJxS_r40k",1790676545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["19","y:P4quH981124",1790676545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["18","y:QOaIWNb51sM",1790676545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[168.4,257.0],[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["17","y:pvXKsgkYWo4",1788084545,"~",null,null,{"d":1443,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1335.7,1370.3]]}],["16","y:IXsqRYtYMGc",1788084545,"~",null,null,{"d":1422,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.6,1419.0]]}],["15","y:hzKYQxY2Ai8",1788084545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["14","y:NFluvFNe1d8",1788084545,"~",null,null,{"d":1422,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.6,1420.0]]}],["13","y:5Gq6N1d1ucc",1788084545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1331.7,1420.0]]}],["12","y:b_s2_yF1te8",1785492545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.4,1419.0]]}],["11","y:sO1FheRYPFQ",1785492545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[234.5,323.0],[1331.4,1419.0]]}],["10","y:Ijb3Wl8fClU",1785492545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1331.5,1419.0]]}],["9","y:pDPjdRmAQIo",1785492545,"~",null,null,{"d":1443,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1351.4,1439.0]]}],["8","y:HNfTd2PwcRQ",1782900545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,90.0],[1331.4,1419.0]]}],["7","y:uYxFTQX_R84",1782900545,"~",null,null,{"d":1423,